---
// Civil Structural & Hauling Logistics Block
---
<section class="civil-block-section"><div class="container"><div class="civil-card"><h2>Confirm the delivery with your supplier</h2><p>Ask for the actual vehicle payload, usable volume, order increment and delivered price. The 15-ton load shown in these estimates is an illustration, not a truck-class rating. Stone density can make a truck reach its payload limit before the bed is full.</p><p>Agree on access, turning space, overhead obstructions, ground conditions and unloading location before delivery. The supplier’s operator must assess the site; a generic clearance or plywood sheet does not establish that a loaded truck can safely enter or tip.</p><p>For separate base and surface quantities, use the <a href="/layered-project-calculator">multi-layer planner</a>. For a soil-separation or stabilization layer, follow the project’s actual detail rather than assuming one geotextile fits every site.</p></div></div></section>

<style>
  .civil-block-section {
    padding: var(--space-8) 0;
  }

  .civil-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.25);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: var(--space-8);
    position: relative;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  }

  .civil-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .civil-icon {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
    color: #60a5fa;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .civil-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: #60a5fa;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .civil-header h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .civil-intro {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .truck-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-4);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .truck-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .truck-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .truck-item {
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-4);
    position: relative;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .truck-item:hover {
    border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.4);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .truck-item.highlight {
    border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.5);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08) 0%, var(--bg-surface) 100%);
  }

  .truck-badge-tag {
    position: absolute;
    top: -10px;
    right: 12px;
    background: #2563eb;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  .truck-name {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .truck-capacity {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #60a5fa;
  }

  .truck-yards {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .truck-desc {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .subgrade-callout {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-4);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .subgrade-icon {
    color: #60a5fa;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .subgrade-callout strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
</style>
